1dkn|n|A coming or happening; as, the occurence of a railway collision. ; Any incident or event; esp., one which happens without being designed or expected; as, an unusual occurrence, or the ordinary occurrences of life.	a:tav,83,5;24yh,81,5;1o3o,78,12;1p3h,59,4;1cwn,46,3;e3m,41,6;rwe,25,7;1oab,20,1~1o3o,78,12;rwe,25,7;e3m,41,6;tav,83,5;24yh,81,5;1p3h,59,4;1cwn,46,3;1oab,20,1
